{
  "format": 1,
  "metadata": {
    "kernelspec": {
      "name": "affon",
      "display_name": "Affon (TypeScript)",
      "language": "typescript"
    }
  },
  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "cell-1",
      "kind": "markdown",
      "language": "markdown",
      "source": "# Tensor Losses\n\nLoss examples using `affon:nn` factories.\n",
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "d5b659fd",
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "typescript",
      "source": "import { tensor } from 'affon:compute'\nimport nn from 'affon:nn'\n\n",
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": 6,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "8e133980",
      "kind": "markdown",
      "language": "markdown",
      "source": "## MSE Loss\n\n$$\n\\mathrm{MSE} = \\frac{1}{N}\\sum_i (\\hat{y}_i - y_i)^2\n$$\n",
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "e9484c5f",
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "typescript",
      "source": "const criterion = nn.MSELoss()\nconst pred = tensor([[[1.0], [2.0]], [[3.0], [4.0]]])\nconst target = tensor([[[1.5], [1.5]], [[2.5], [3.5]]])\nconsole.log('before prediction')\nconsole.log(pred)\nconsole.log('before target')\nconsole.log(target)\nconsole.log('after MSE loss')\nconsole.log(criterion(pred, target))\n",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "mime": "application/vnd.tsnb.stream.stdout",
              "value": "before prediction\n[2×2×1 Tensor, dtype=f32]\n[[[1], [2]], [[3], [4]]]\n\nbefore target\n[2×2×1 Tensor, dtype=f32]\n[[[1.5], [1.5]], [[2.5], [3.5]]]\n\nafter MSE loss\n[1 Tensor, dtype=f32]\n  0     \n[ 0.25  ]\n\n"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "execution_count": 7,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "3d1b892b",
      "kind": "markdown",
      "language": "markdown",
      "source": "## BCE Loss\n\n$$\n\\mathrm{BCE} = -\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_i \\left[y_i \\log p_i + (1-y_i)\\log(1-p_i)\\right]\n$$\n",
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "b9bb7208",
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "typescript",
      "source": "const criterion = nn.BCELoss()\nconst pred = tensor([[[0.9], [0.2]], [[0.7], [0.4]]])\nconst target = tensor([[[1.0], [0.0]], [[1.0], [0.0]]])\nconsole.log('before probabilities')\nconsole.log(pred)\nconsole.log('before target')\nconsole.log(target)\nconsole.log('after BCE loss')\nconsole.log(criterion(pred, target))\n",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "mime": "application/vnd.tsnb.stream.stdout",
              "value": "before probabilities\n[2×2×1 Tensor, dtype=f32]\n[[[0.9], [0.2]], [[0.7], [0.4]]]\n\nbefore target\n[2×2×1 Tensor, dtype=f32]\n[[[1], [0]], [[1], [0]]]\n\nafter BCE loss\n[1 Tensor, dtype=f32]\n  0         \n[ 0.299001  ]\n\n"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "execution_count": 8,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "20931c82",
      "kind": "markdown",
      "language": "markdown",
      "source": "## BCE With Logits Loss\n\nPlain text:\n\n`mean(max(x, 0) - x * y + log(1 + exp(-abs(x))))`\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_i \\left(\\max(x_i,0) - x_i y_i + \\log(1 + e^{-|x_i|})\\right)\n$$\n",
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "6794c6ba",
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "typescript",
      "source": "const criterion = nn.BCEWithLogitsLoss()\nconst logits = tensor([[[2.0], [-1.5]], [[0.8], [-0.3]]])\nconst target = tensor([[[1.0], [0.0]], [[1.0], [0.0]]])\nconsole.log('before logits')\nconsole.log(logits)\nconsole.log('before target')\nconsole.log(target)\nconsole.log('after BCEWithLogits loss')\nconsole.log(criterion(logits, target))\n",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "mime": "application/vnd.tsnb.stream.stdout",
              "value": "before logits\n[2×2×1 Tensor, dtype=f32]\n[[[2], [-1.5]], [[0.8], [-0.3]]]\n\nbefore target\n[2×2×1 Tensor, dtype=f32]\n[[[1], [0]], [[1], [0]]]\n\nafter BCEWithLogits loss\n[1 Tensor, dtype=f32]\n  0         \n[ 0.313449  ]\n\n"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "execution_count": 9,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "4aaaba23",
      "kind": "markdown",
      "language": "markdown",
      "source": "## Cross Entropy Loss\n\nThis example uses indexed class targets with an explicit \n`target: 'index'` option.\n\n$$\n\\mathrm{CE} = -\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_i \\log \\mathrm{softmax}(x_i)_{y_i}\n$$\n",
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "0f337adf",
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "typescript",
      "source": "const criterion = nn.CrossEntropyLoss({ target: 'index' })\nconst logits = tensor([\n  [2.0, 0.5, -1.0],\n  [0.1, 1.2, 0.3],\n  [1.5, 0.2, -0.4],\n  [0.3, 0.7, 1.8],\n])\nconst target = tensor([0, 1, 0, 2], 'i64')\nconsole.log('before logits')\nconsole.log(logits)\nconsole.log('before indexed targets')\nconsole.log(target)\nconsole.log('after cross entropy loss')\nconsole.log(criterion(logits, target))\n",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "mime": "application/vnd.tsnb.stream.stdout",
              "value": "before logits\n[4×3 Tensor, dtype=f32]\n       0    1     2\n  ┌                  ┐\n0 │    2  0.5    -1  │\n1 │  0.1  1.2   0.3  │\n2 │  1.5  0.2  -0.4  │\n3 │  0.3  0.7   1.8  │\n  └                  ┘\n\nbefore indexed targets\n[4 Tensor, dtype=f32]\n  0  1  2  3  \n[ 0  1  0  2  ]\n\nafter cross entropy loss\n[1 Tensor, dtype=f32]\n  0         \n[ 0.397282  ]\n\n"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "execution_count": 10,
      "metadata": {}
    }
  ]
}
